॰ ══════════════════ why parsing failed ══════════════════
॰ struct ParseError. कूट is the diagnostic code from spec/diagnostics.tsv
॰ — P01, P26, L02 — and a caller asking WHAT went wrong reads it rather
॰ than the prose, so a test does not pin whichever language the parser was
॰ built to speak. कारणम् is that prose. Rust's args: Vec<String> is a run
॰ in पाठांशकोश, in the order the template names them.

