॰ ══════════════════ POST-CHECK 2 — P25, AT THE MARK THAT OPENED ══════════════════
॰ A directive left open swallows whatever follows it, so it is reported at
॰ THE ॥ THAT OPENED IT and not at the end of the file — which is the whole
॰ reason उद्घाटकः stores an arena index rather than a flag: a flag would
॰ know that a directive is open and not know where it began.

