॰ ══════════════════ is this token the closing word? ══════════════════
॰ Rust writes args[i] == "इति". Here a token is a RANGE in a source, so
॰ the comparison is पाठसाम्यम् against इतिशब्दः — length first, then
॰ octets. The literal's own range is ० to its दैर्घ्य.

॰ ॥ इतिशब्दः ॥ THE CLOSING WORD ITSELF, as a run of octets to compare against.
॰
॰ USED AT `इतिपदम्` BELOW AND DECLARED NOWHERE — the resolver's first refusal
॰ for this file. The margin above describes the comparison in detail and the
॰ name it compares against was never brought into being.
॰
॰ IT COULD NOT HAVE BEEN WRITTEN UNTIL TODAY. The literal `इति` is spelled
॰ `उक्तम् इति इति इति` — ADR-0011's doubled close — and `व्याकर`'s string
॰ scanner closed on the FIRST `इति` until W-185, so this declaration would have
॰ ended after one word and left `इति इति` loose.
॰ W-239 (2026-09-04): AND STILL IT WAS EMPTY. The interpreter (`nirvahana.rs`)
॰ ignored a literal initializer on a slice-typed GLOBAL — `भवति उक्तम् अब इति`
॰ on a global was the empty run, the same literal inside a routine the text
॰ (probed; filed as W-242). So `इतिपदम्` compared every token against nothing
॰ and every literal was P22 "unclosed". W-239 built the word from octets in
॰ `अङ्कपाठरचना`, as the digit texts are.
॰ W-242 (2026-09-04): THE LOADER EVALUATES THE INITIALIZER NOW, and this is
॰ the literal again — the one place in the corpus a global is a string. The
॰ octet table in `अङ्कपाठरचना` is gone with it.
॰ 2026-09-21: AND THE IMAGE STILL HAD IT EMPTY. W-242 fixed the INTERPRETER's
॰ loader; the NATIVE lowering drops a global's literal initializer to this day,
॰ so in the compiled compiler `इतिपदम्` compared every token against the empty
॰ run. It went unseen only because compiler-emitted Sassembly carries its
॰ strings as octets and never reaches `इतिपदम्`. A routine returning the
॰ literal is honoured by both engines; a bare name of it is still a call.
सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः इतिशब्दः ददाति अङ्कः अन्तः अ८ आदि
    प्रत्यागमनम् उक्तम् इति इति इति ।
इति

सार्वजनिक वृत्तिः इतिपदम् आदाय क्रमः ॱॱ अ६४ ददाति बूल आदि
    चरः चिह्नकम् ॱॱ पदविभागॱचिह्नक भवति पदविभागॱचिह्नककोश अङ्कः क्रमः अन्तः ।
    प्रत्यागमनम् पाठसाम्यम् आरभ्य चिह्नकम् ॱ पाठ ऽ चिह्नकम् ॱ अष्टक ऽ चिह्नकम् ॱ पाठसीमा ऽ इतिशब्दः ऽ ० ऽ इतिशब्दः ॱ दैर्घ्य समाप्तम् ।
